    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Is it possible to pass the currently highlighted text as the search to grep_live and buf_lines? I'm thinking like what `*` does in vmode but put everything in a picker.",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Is it possible to pass the currently highlighted text as the search to grep_live and buf_lines? I'm thinking like what <code class=\"notranslate\">*</code> does in vmode but put everything in a picker.</p>",
    "bodyText": "Is it possible to pass the currently highlighted text as the search to grep_live and buf_lines? I'm thinking like what * does in vmode but put everything in a picker.",
