                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "cword only does the first word highlighted. If the highlighted text contains spaces (or other delimiters?) <cword> only expands to the first word.\r\n\r\ne.g. `:echo expand(\"<cword>\") with `a b c` highlighted only prints `a`",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">cword only does the first word highlighted. If the highlighted text contains spaces (or other delimiters?)  only expands to the first word.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">e.g. <code class=\"notranslate\">:echo expand(\"&lt;cword&gt;\") with </code>a b c<code class=\"notranslate\">highlighted only prints</code>a`</p>",
                    "bodyText": "cword only does the first word highlighted. If the highlighted text contains spaces (or other delimiters?)  only expands to the first word.\ne.g. :echo expand(\"<cword>\") with a b chighlighted only printsa`",
